# Supabase Configuration (Optional)
# If these are not set, the app will use localStorage only

# Your Supabase project URL
# REACT_APP_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co

# Your Supabase anonymous/public key
# REACT_APP_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# To enable Supabase cloud sync:
# 1. Create a free account at https://supabase.com
# 2. Create a new project
# 3. Copy your project URL and anon key from Settings > API
# 4. Uncomment the lines above and paste your credentials
# 5. Create a .env file (copy this file and rename it to .env)
# 6. Restart the dev server

# Without Supabase configured, the app works perfectly with localStorage
